// File: zannastudio/src/ui/scene_editor_2d_renderer.zia
// Purpose: Focused renderer behavior for the 2D scene editor controller.
// Key invariants:
//   - Each method overrides one contract slot while preserving transactional behavior.
// Ownership/Lifetime:
//   - The SceneEditor2D facade owns inherited resources; this layer adds no independent lifetime.
// Links: zannastudio/src/ui/scene_editor_2d.zia, zannastudio/src/ui/scene_editor_2d_rulers.zia
//
